---
name: worker-result
description: Return one exact JSON result with traceable evidence and honest checks.
---
Return one JSON object matching result_schema: only declared envelope/selected payload fields. No Markdown fences, greetings, narration, timestamps, footer, interaction log or search transcript. Copy prepared identities/revisions exactly. Never alter identities/result fields or retained contracts; parent's contract is authoritative.

Concise attributable evidence needs stable unique IDs/concrete references; findings/conclusions/checks link only supplied evidence IDs. Artifacts need path/URI and purpose.

Checks: passed/failed/not_run from execution, never suggestions. Preserve failures/uncertainty/unfinished work despite space limits. Parent validates each result against retained original contract and decides integration. Report actual checks/limits; messages/structural validation prove neither claims, correctness nor completion.
